          "lineage": "Batopora",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Small conical conescharelliniform colonies with a flattened base an apical tube comprised of kenozooids and terminated by a small pit. Hexagonal zooids arranged in concentric alternating series. Frontal convex with fairly large pores. Large circular aperture located in the distal part of each zooid. No avicularia. Rare small broken hyperstomial ovicells are visible (Fig. 12 A).",
